WEBVTT

00:10:29.189 --> 00:10:30.950
That's the synthesis of happiness.

00:10:30.974 --> 00:10:32.624
(Laughter)

00:10:32.648 --> 00:10:34.786
Now, what's the right response to that?

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:36.391
"Yeah, right!"

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:39.482
Now, here's the experiment we did,

00:10:39.506 --> 00:10:41.468
and I hope this is going to convince you

00:10:41.492 --> 00:10:43.722
that "Yeah, right!"
was not the right response.

00:10:43.746 --> 00:10:45.938
We did this experiment
with a group of patients

00:10:45.962 --> 00:10:47.299
who had anterograde amnesia.

00:10:47.323 --> 00:10:48.982
These are hospitalized patients.

00:10:49.006 --> 00:10:51.171
Most of them have Korsakoff syndrome,

00:10:51.195 --> 00:10:53.352
a polyneuritic psychosis.

00:10:53.955 --> 00:10:57.856
They drank way too much,
and they can't make new memories.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:01.329
They remember their childhood,
but if you walk in and introduce yourself